# Prototype market-data corpus. READ .agent/prototypes/undercut-formula/README.md BEFORE
# fetching anything. Roughly 832 MB of cached aggregator data across ~2,740 files, held on the
# maintainer's working copy and deliberately never committed: this repository is public, that
# volume is permanent in every clone, and the aggregator publishes no data licence. It is also
# not cheaply reproducible - about 1,200 requests and the best part of an hour per World - so
# an absent directory is not an invitation to re-scrape.
.agent/prototypes/undercut-formula/data/
.agent/prototypes/undercut-formula/data_all/
.agent/prototypes/undercut-formula/data_adam/

# Python bytecode from the prototypes
__pycache__/
*.pyc
